  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_6400.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>El antiguo colegio Monteblanco de Onda acoge hasta este domingo una nueva edici&oacute;n del Campeonato de Colombicultura de Palomos de Raza Comunitat Valenciana 2014 y el X Concurso de Colombicultura de Palomos de Raza Vila d&#39;Onda. Este s&aacute;bado se puede visitar todav&iacute;a la exposici&oacute;n de los ejemplares de 10 a 13 horas y de 16 a&nbsp;20 horas. Tambi&eacute;n antes de la entrega de premios, que&nbsp;es el domingo 30,&nbsp;a las 13 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6383.jpg\" alt=\"img_6383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6385.jpg\" alt=\"img_6385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6386.jpg\" alt=\"img_6386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6388.jpg\" alt=\"img_6388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6390.jpg\" alt=\"img_6390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6393.jpg\" alt=\"img_6393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6394.jpg\" alt=\"img_6394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/campionatcvcolomsraca14/img_6397.jpg\" alt=\"img_6397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\